# ========================================
# AVATAR GENERATOR - LOCAL OVERRIDE TEMPLATE
# ========================================
# Environment: Local Development Override
# Last updated: 19-06-2025
# Version: 1.0.0
# Maintainer: @gabch
# Project: Avatar Generator
# 
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Replace 'your_*_here' with your actual values
# 3. Never commit .env.local to git
# 4. These values override .env when present
# 5. Set here personal variables present at .env with your specific values if needed
# ========================================

# ========================================
# PERSONAL OVERRIDE VALUES
# ========================================
# Add here any values from .env that you want to override
# For example:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_IPFS_GATEWAY=your_personal_ipfs_gateway_url
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VRM_PROCESS_SERVICE_URL=your_personal_vrm_service_url

# ========================================
# PERSONAL DEVELOPMENT SETTINGS
# ========================================
# Add here your personal development preferences
# For example:
# NODE_ENV=development
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEBUG=true
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOG_LEVEL=debug

# ========================================
# NOTES
# ========================================
# - This file is for personal overrides only
# - Keep it minimal - only override what you need
# - If you don't need to override anything, you can leave this file empty
# - This file takes precedence over .env